The three ensemble plots below are generated from the same ten paired seed
triplets and the same current validation bundle. In particular, OU--III
Adaptive uses the analytically derived SpectralMSE integral-state schedule of
Sec.~\ref{sec:adaptation}; these figures do not restore any retired cubic-law
comparison.

